            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kim"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I really enjoyed these sugar cookies! Only change I made to the recipe was to up the vanilla, and add some salt. Otherwise, I followed it as written. The dough was super easy to work with and roll out; and the cookies held their shape quite well after baking too. They only required 7 minutes in the oven for me. The cookies are buttery, not too sweet (which is perfect when you want to frost them with buttercream!), and have a nice chewy-soft texture. Would definitely make these again! Thank you for sharing your recipe!",
